abstract: "Code, Colab notebooks and result archives for XC-AdaGuiDE, an adaptive differential evolution method with a post-run consistency test between Sobol total-order indices and forward-difference local importance. Includes the benchmark study, parameter sweeps, noise and block-rotation experiments, and the maglev and quadrotor PID case studies."
